{"type":"message","id":"649d073f","parentId":"89728614","timestamp":"2026-05-24T17:16:14.298Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This could be a Workers/Cloudflare error code. The endpoint might be having issues. Let me check if there's a different endpoint format or if there's something wrong with the request.\n\nActually, the content-length shows 79 bytes but the JSON I sent is longer. Let me try a simpler test to see if the send endpoint is working at all.\n\nLet me also try a GET to check the health of the platform.\n","thinkingSignature":"e1d08311544bd50d4342a05106f98ea4b3a24ece5f9771f8375068aa5e381ea9"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tgot3ywky2j4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\" -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tgot3ywky2j4_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat test 17:15 UTC\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1498,"output":254,"cacheRead":19901,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21653,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779642967493,"responseId":"06626558b2d0044667bd9bbe9526b7fc"}}
