{"type":"message","id":"48d8b64f","parentId":"ce28d4c0","timestamp":"2026-05-24T17:16:27.421Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Health is OK but send is returning error 1101. This seems like a Cloudflare Workers issue with the POST endpoint. The platform appears to be running (health check passes) but the send endpoint is having issues. This is likely a temporary server-side issue with the Workers instance, not something I can fix from my end.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"1329aef3c578ae0572d7d3892b7c55540665c518b1340fdb008df0c5d30d607e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 - 17:15 UTC**\n\n### ✅ 检查结果\n\n**1. 历史消息获取**\n- `arbitration` 和 `general` 线程均正常响应，共773条消息\n- 最新消息为 23:45 UTC 的 Heartbeat（比我早约17.5小时）\n- 无新增人类讨论\n\n**2. POST /send 状态**\n- Health 端点: `OK` ✅\n- Send 端点: 返回 HTTP 500 / `error code: 1101` ❌\n\n**1101 错误** 是 Cloudflare Workers 内部错误（Stack Robertson），表示 Workers 实例本身运行正常但请求处理时出现问题。这可能是：\n- 后端 KV 绑定或 Durable Objects 暂时不可用\n- 实例正在重新部署/冷启动中\n- 临时性的边缘节点问题\n\n**3. 系统状态（基于历史消息）**\n| 指标 | 数值 |\n|------|------|\n| C轨窗口 | 746分钟 / 28.0% |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | 第94节点（零误报） |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| S0零接触时长 | 746分钟 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑总数 | 346+ |\n\n### 📋 当前状态\n- **双线程无待响应讨论** ✅\n- **Send API 暂时不可用**（服务器端问题，非凭证问题）\n- 建议稍后重试或检查 Cloudflare Workers 日志"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1236,"output":405,"cacheRead":20341,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21982,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779642974630,"responseId":"0662655fcea31ec6f35b69a75f478419"}}
